# PostgreSQL local credentials are configured in wrangler.dev.jsonc.
# Production migration credentials belong in .env or the build secret DATABASE_URL.
# Do not copy DATABASE_URL into Worker runtime vars.
# No additional runtime secrets are needed for local development.
# Optional browser notifications: copy to .dev.vars, uncomment the lines below,
# and fill in a matching key pair from `npm run vapid:generate`.
# For production, add these as Worker secrets; see docs/deployment.md.
# Never commit real values.
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
# VAPID_PRIVATE_JWK=
# VAPID_SUBJECT=mailto:admin@example.com
